1. It was equipped with a Merlin 45 series engine and had several improvements that increased the aircraft maneuverability. Several Spitfire Mk V variants were flown by the Polish fighter squadrons in the RAF, most famously by Squadrons No. 303 and No. 302 who had a distinguished combat record and received several battle honours.","LocalizedString":"The Supermarine Spitfire was a British fighter aircraft that was used in WWII and the only fighter that was in service from the start of the war in 1939 and until it ended in 1945. The Mk V variant came in three versions and had several sub-variants, and was produced in 1941. It was equipped with a Merlin 45 series engine and had several improvements that increased the aircraft maneuverability. Several Spitfire Mk V variants were flown by the Polish fighter squadrons in the RAF, most famously by Squadrons No. 303 and No. 302 who had a distinguished combat record and received several battle honours."},"operationCost":2,"rarity":"ERarityEnum::Uncommon","selectTargetOnPlayedFromHand":true,"cardSet":"ECardSetEnum::Legions","isInPermanentPool":true,"extraHelpTextBubbleTypes":["EHelpBubbleTypes::Exile","EHelpBubbleTypes::Deployment"],"hasDeployment":true,"exileNation":"EFactionEnum::Britain","soundBlowUp":{"ObjectName":"SoundCue'AU_Exp_Aircraft_Medium_Cue'","ObjectPath":"kards/Content/Assets/Audio/Card_Blowups/AU_Exp_Aircraft_Medium_Cue.0"},"Image":{"AssetPathName":"/Game/Assets/Textures/Images/Poland/t_spitfire_v_pol.t_spitfire_v_pol","SubPathString":""},"ImageAnchor":"EImageAnchor::Bot","artist":"Jarosław Wróbel","historyPhoto":{"AssetPathName":"/Game/Assets/Textures/HistoricalPhotos/SPITFIRE_Mk_V_POL.SPITFIRE_Mk_V_POL","SubPathString":""},"historyPhotoSize":{"X":512.0,"Y":337.0},"historyPhotoDescription":{"Namespace":"card_poland","Key":"card_unit_spitfire_mk_v_pol_photo","SourceString":"Spitfire Mk.Vb, RF-D, flown by pilot Jan Zumbachof the No. 303 Squadron.","LocalizedString":"Spitfire Mk.Vb, RF-D, flown by pilot Jan Zumb